            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 115129,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengguna dapat masuk jika mereka <em>tidak</em> gagal dalam pengujian bot. Gunakan operator untuk memeriksa apakah pengguna dapat masuk.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" failedBotTest = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loggedIn = !failedBotTest; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + loggedIn);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logged in? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengguna dapat masuk jika mereka <em>tidak</em> gagal dalam pengujian bot. Gunakan operator untuk memeriksa apakah pengguna dapat masuk.</p><p>Atur boolean <code>failedBotTest</code> agar konsol menampilkan <code>Logged in? : true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" failedBotTest = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loggedIn = !failedBotTest; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Logged in? : &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + loggedIn);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Logged in? : true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>false</code>, diikuti oleh <code>!</code>.</p></body></html>",
